, 'long_summary': '8月17日，电信终端产业协会面向全行业发出倡议，在充分保障消费者知情权与自主选择权的前提下，稳步推行手机整机与配件分离销售模式，杜绝无效标配、重复配套，从产品源头减少冗余配件产出，降低资源消耗。这一倡议再度将“手机不再默认标配充电器”话题推至台前。《中国经营报》记者采访了市场研究机构Omdia欧洲地区的手机分析师，并随机采访了在欧洲的消费者，试图厘清这一模式在欧洲市场的实际落地情况。Omdia首席分析师Runar Bjørhovde向记者表示，欧洲智能手机市场的新标准是销售不带充电器的手机。'}, {'id': '20260821V0CI8Q00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '芯片涨价潮来了', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-21 19:23:58', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OLWVDfaRq8EFeCHLU3IJops9kQsyfdpjcmzJhYPbEBUugAA_870492_compress/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Ob2I2CUjEYthU2bPR4-Y8fCoe2_G13Cq0w_mzyny6PQSYAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OLJ5lGGEVXccM5wkmY9yPEhUZT1ox6RLUH6holHIN0quMAA_150120/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Ob2I2CUjEYthU2bPR4-Y8fCoe2_G13Cq0w_mzyny6PQSYAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Ob2I2CUjEYthU2bPR4-Y8fCoe2_G13Cq0w_mzyny6PQSYAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Ob2I2CUjEYthU2bPR4-Y8fCoe2_G13Cq0w_mzyny6PQSYAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Ob2I2CUjEYthU2bPR4-Y8fCoe2_G13Cq0w_mzyny6PQSYAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O8Zc6JvITdSTVSXMmagTqoIRl9RQlxHbsJ8m469IzWrZwAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/w128421ykts/w128421ykts_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0CI8Q00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260821V0CI8Q00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0CI8Q00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0CI8Q00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5049062', 'chl_name': '财经杂志', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12431403664_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12431403664_200200/0', 'mrk': '《财经》秉承“独立、独家、独到”的理念，是以权威性、公正性、专业性深度原创报道见长的全媒体平台', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec9f74dc538644c1b7906b98ce0741d5a1', 'encoded_suid': '8QMc33tc7IYfvT/Q', 'vip_type': '30013',