000万美元全额保障合同的球员，首位自然是詹姆斯。今年季后赛带队时隔八年打进东决，场均亮相37.3分钟砍下19.2分5.1板5.5助1.7断，两项命中率41%与29.9%。'}, {'id': '20260821V0827B00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '输不起！中国男篮战胜菲律宾锁定世界杯资格 对手最后2.5秒挑事', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-21 15:00:12', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4rvKsFyJJ_tzlK19o1_vs2-qrMdLvurGXRiya-Ee4tIQAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4rvKsFyJJ_tzlK19o1_vs2-qrMdLvurGXRiya-Ee4tIQAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OhBahqj6j_pGoOvxEk-a6vuzF-7NJTWLOGL4wIznyoJ-IAA_150120/0'], 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4rvKsFyJJ_tzlK19o1_vs2-qrMdLvurGXRiya-Ee4tIQAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4rvKsFyJJ_tzlK19o1_vs2-qrMdLvurGXRiya-Ee4tIQAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O4rvKsFyJJ_tzlK19o1_vs2-qrMdLvurGXRiya-Ee4tIQAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-Q-DBJpPT140sMEj3Ig3wgV3eZLvvRv7ChWHGr1YgU-UAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '1.78', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/i1284uwldxo/i1284uwldxo_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0827B00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260821V0827B00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0827B00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260821V0827B00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '18998553', 'chl_name': '无敌边线球', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12493358575_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12493358575_200200/0', 'mrk': '没有什么是比边线球更难的', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec07e0519f16a982cb9372f9f406092540', 'encoded_suid': '8QMf2Xhd7Y0cuDbQ', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '体育领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876048581/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 4, 'medal_id': 8, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '日积月累30天', 'medal_desc': '累计发表评论30天', 'night_url': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0107170532213_9431/0', 'daytime_url': 'http