0d8月19日，宇树科技登陆科创板。开盘1100元，市值一度冲上4449亿元。这个数字本身就足够震撼——它远超市场此前普遍预期的1500亿至2000亿区间，动态市盈率一度突破800倍。但比数字更先出圈的，是创始人王兴兴在敲钟现场那张凝重的脸。这不是一次成功的IPO，至少在传播维度上，它是一场彻头彻尾的失败。就在宇树IPO的第二天，2026世界机器人大会在北京开幕。', 'declares': [{'type': 'self_declare', 'text': '作者声明：个人观点，仅供参考', 'self_declare_id': 2}]}, {'id': '20260820V0DGVD00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '胡锡进：许家印在巅峰时处在一个很庸俗的水平，以为自己“大到不能倒”', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-20 19:58:55', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMvznCQj6gM89oU2EiNpAYrjVPcz8C6O_CeNTP5VviggwAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMvznCQj6gM89oU2EiNpAYrjVPcz8C6O_CeNTP5VviggwAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Owzluurj79SbFGzquPbjpbXCanS_iCJduB8pHwVz_pQawAA_150120/0'], 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMvznCQj6gM89oU2EiNpAYrjVPcz8C6O_CeNTP5VviggwAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMvznCQj6gM89oU2EiNpAYrjVPcz8C6O_CeNTP5VviggwAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMvznCQj6gM89oU2EiNpAYrjVPcz8C6O_CeNTP5VviggwAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O7Szh2HQm5fumD83xEo5LkTdX2pdffDlObvuJNzTFXICsAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '1.78', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/l1283qsior7/l1283qsior7_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820V0DGVD00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260820V0DGVD00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820V0DGVD00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820V0DGVD00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '24849261', 'chl_name': '山海观隅', 'icon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMac-ZAP1Qg6ZWuJFbtV2Fk0L9G5XDW4q1OQEh6bHPmKQAA_200200/0', 'sicon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OMac-ZAP1Qg6ZWuJFbtV2Fk0L9G5XDW4q1OQEh6bHPmKQAA_200200/0', 'mrk': '精译、整理、拆解世界实时动态，收录世间不同声音与人间百态。', 'last_art_update': '0', 'encoded_suid': '8QMc339c6IQcuDjf5gNz', 'vip_type': '0', 'vip_type_new': '0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 24, 'medal_id': 38, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '初露锋